1521830722346429", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818916_1521830725679762_1465834721504573858_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dpE2UpylT5kQ7kNvwEIOcTn&_nc_oc=AdrgRBfAbU8yoll0uH6hTiCBFqps7Sg4-X6dI6Tj3DwMPbktE07AfTz9tssUINLRZ6k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4gIud28rZ-H2eFieeuTRmW7g89DkkfvjWLzffU7K1p4A&oe=69FF1FDC"}, {"file_name": "39035397_1205901727152563_7583367210078983654_n.png", "id": "826780613076960", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307413_826780616410293_5266478195837479583_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IIq1IVlGL-MQ7kNvwHzgILQ&_nc_oc=Adpd3ulfjSk1B8Y2UHt0AAZtvqS2K0r8CM3Oyr0CG73FAojCsIEOQ5zXbxW67UorXKg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5Fm8eklUhIykdO1soMBrT3HVdYrW59bEznAb8dKuV8uQ&oe=69FF374F"}, {"file_name": "Adobe Express - file (21).png", "id": "1368318864501538", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392034_1368318867834871_1138933622027331256_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MJNCDZTeNaUQ7kNvwGdMqKc&_nc_oc=AdoP19QraPfofTtA5-z5CnHIIGkxvuveME5GbD4afmE-lXQbEyd4sGZ1vDDiu-a83E4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6vye4z8s0DqjlOvIk_bgBXdhK9D7yD3wy32LJkfV8lvA&oe=69FF51E2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "G3N3SIS Cover.png", "id": "2322699961473584", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818890_2322699964806917_6979417875942973266_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xuYwT4VXvVQQ7kNvwF7sa6l&_nc_oc=Adr19L4krezf3-PX1AWby7BTtjPiVZRjMl1RRDJn-Rzg2oILqLPIKC-NzumYIpWWSqI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5hxSZjBEWfyDKq7CAqFX1gcE1flPZ0Atp2sudcXPu6UQ&oe=69FF4E2B"}, "display_name": "MasterRunners", "keywords": ["runners", "master", "mrvr", "mrvrv2", "masterunner"], "long_description": "# Welcome to the MasterRunners Page.\n\nMasterRunners is a free-to-play, hand-based movement VR multiplayer game packed with fun and variety. It offers a one-of-a-kind experience that stands out in the VR space. Whether you're into fast-paced action or just looking to hang out with friends, MasterRunners has something for everyone.\n\n# What you can do:\n- Play Gamemodes with players across the **WORLD**. MasterRunners can be played worldwide and with our **advanced multiplayer system**, you can enjoy multiplayer & have a very fun time. For the gamemodes, we build special gamemodes that have never been used in others games making us stand out and more fun.\n{1355181399287310}\n- Chill with friends and have a **great time.** With areas such as the \"Main Hub\", you can relax and have a calming time with buddies as you talk to your hearts desire.\n{760051716616133}\n- Shop for new cosmetics at the Master Mart with the in-game currency... Energy! Using energy, you can get all kinds of cosmetics of any type just with one click. This is how you can customize your character!\n{2223357978126342}\n\nAnd more. \n\nThere is lots to do in MasterRunners, so check it out **TODAY!**\n{1421192876087856}", "short_description": "Complete Obstacles, Beat Gamemodes, & Be yourself to show, you can be apart of the MasterRunners."}]}, "developer_name": "EMVRGames", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.masterrunnersvr.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "EthanMonke", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.masterrunnersvr.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL", "RACING", "STRATEGY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_grap